@startuml
title Delete Pending Letter - Call Sequence
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "Bureau user / API client" as Client
participant "Spring Security /\nrequest validation" as Security
participant LetterController as Controller
participant "ReissueLetterServiceImpl\n(via ReissueLetterService)" as Service
participant SecurityUtil as SecurityUtil
participant "BulkPrintDataRepository\n(custom query: IReissueLetterRepositoryImpl)" as Letters
participant JurorPoolUtils as PoolUtils
participant JurorPoolRepository as Pools
participant JurorHistoryService as History

Client -> Security : DELETE /api/v1/moj/letter/delete-pending-letter
note over Security
  @IsBureauUser requires Bureau access.
  Request body is subject to @Valid / @NotNull validation.
  ReissueLetterRequestDto requires a non-empty letters list.
  Rejected requests do not reach the service.
end note
Security -> Controller : deletePendingLetter(request)
Controller -> Service : deletePendingLetter(request)
activate Service
Service -> SecurityUtil : getActiveUsersBureauPayload()
SecurityUtil --> Service : authenticated payload
Service -> Service : Read login; select request.letters.getFirst()
note right of Service
  Only the first requested letter is processed.
  Additional list entries are ignored.
  The lookup uses juror number and form code,
  not the submitted print date.
end note
Service -> Service : deletePendingLetter(jurorNumber, formCode)
Service -> Letters : findLatestPendingLetterForJuror(jurorNumber, formCode)
note right of Letters
  Filter by juror number and form code.
  Pending means extractedFlag is null or false,
  OR emailStatus is PENDING.
  Order by creationDate descending and fetch first.
end note
Letters --> Service : Optional<BulkPrintData>

break No matching pending letter
  Service -> Service : Private helper returns false
  Service --> Controller : throw MojException.NotFound
  Controller --> Client : HTTP 404 via exception handling
end

Service -> Letters : delete(bulkPrintData)

opt Form code is ENG_REQUESTINFO or BI_REQUESTINFO
  Service -> PoolUtils : getActiveJurorPoolForUser(jurorPoolRepository, jurorNumber)
  PoolUtils -> SecurityUtil : getActiveOwner()
  SecurityUtil --> PoolUtils : current owner
  PoolUtils -> Pools : findByJurorJurorNumberAndIsActiveAndOwner(\njurorNumber, true, currentOwner)
  Pools --> PoolUtils : jurorPool or null

  break No active pool association for the current owner
    PoolUtils --> Service : throw MojException.NotFound
    Service --> Controller : exception propagates
    Controller --> Client : HTTP 404 via exception handling
    note over Service, Letters
      The service method is transactional.
      This exception rolls back the deletion.
    end note
  end

  PoolUtils --> Service : jurorPool
  Service -> History : createDeleteAdditionalInfoLetterHistory(jurorPool)
  note right of History
    Records DELETE_REQUEST_MORE_INFO history.
    Other form codes do not create deletion history here.
  end note
end

Service -> Service : Private helper returns true
Service --> Controller : completed
deactivate Service
Controller --> Client : HTTP 200 OK; body = "Letters reissued"

legend bottom
  Service entry method is @Transactional.
  This endpoint deletes a pending record; it does not reissue letters.
  The success response text is reproduced from the controller.
  Repository persistence and history-service internals are omitted.
  Exceptions terminate the flow and propagate to framework exception handling.
endlegend
@enduml
